+## Trust Boundary Rule
+
+AI may: index, extract, structure, populate templates, draft, compare and cross-check, always with source pointers.
+
+Humans own: understanding project intent, measured quantities, percent complete, entitlement and notices, negotiation, award, acceptance and any approval.
+
+Unknown-value rule: when a rate, quantity, date or clause is not supported by source evidence, the system raises it as `Unknown / Missing Evidence`. It never invents, interpolates or silently defaults a governed value.
+
+Agent handover templates must repeat this rule. See AI-fit labels in FEIS-CM-0902 §5A.
+
 ## Deterministic Boundary
 
 Numerical calculations that affect engineering/commercial outcomes should use approved deterministic calculation services where feasible.
